            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2026.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## [2026.2] - 2026-11-13

### Added

- If opened in a location other than `/Applications`, Beekeeper offers to move itself to the Applications folder, where it can update itself.
- A job's snapshot list shows how much its snapshots share, so the sizes add up to the total.

### Fixed

- Beekeeper can connect to a Hive at a Tailscale address.
]]></description>
